11
01:04:54,000 --> 01:05:00,000
The Hitman's Bodyguard is a 2017 action comedy film directed
by Patrick Hughes and written by Tom O'Connor.

12
01:10:48,000 --> 01:10:54,000
It stars Ryan Reynolds, Samuel L.

13
01:16:42,000 --> 01:16:48,000
Jackson, Gary Oldman and Salma Hayek.

14
01:22:36,000 --> 01:22:42,000
In the film, Michael Bryce (Reynolds) must protect Darius Kincaid (Jackson), an imprisoned hitman on his way to testify at
the International Criminal Court against a sadistic Eastern European dictator Vladislav Dukhovich (Oldman).

15
01:28:30,000 --> 01:28:36,000
The Hitman's Bodyguard was released in the United States on 18
August 2017 and grossed $183 million worldwide.

16
01:34:24,000 --> 01:34:30,000
It received mixed reviews from critics, who praised its performances, action sequences, and the
chemistry between Reynolds and Jackson, but criticized its plot and execution.

17
01:40:18,000 --> 01:40:24,000
A sequel titled Hitman's Wife's Bodyguard was released on 16 June 2021.

18
01:46:12,000 --> 01:46:18,000
The film explores themes of assassin, court, england, hitman, bodyguard.

19
01:52:06,000 --> 01:52:12,000
The tone is lighthearted and intense.
